  script:
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Hey Adana! Funny seeing you here.
    - "What\u2019s a pro like you doing around these parts?"
    - "Well regardless\u2026 Welcome to the new training facility! Let me give you
      a tour."
    - "Here you\u2019ll be able to familiarize yourself with everything you need
      to know to accomplish whatever bounty you\u2019ll be given."
  secondTimeArountScript:
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Welp, that's the facility.
    - "Feel free to spend as much time as you\u2019d like to familiarize yourself
      and you can always come back whenever you need a refresher."
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - ...
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Whaaaaat.
    - "I know you\u2019re very capable but it\u2019s part of the script Adana I have
      to say it. Haha.."
